# Tutors

This folder is intentionally empty.

No profile goes on the site until that tutor has cleared verification: score
report read, university confirmed in writing, sample lesson taught, background
check cleared. While it is empty, `/tutors` and the homepage show a pre-launch
state instead of sample people, and every "N tutors" figure disappears.

To add a real tutor, create `firstname-lastname.md` with the frontmatter shape
defined in `src/content.config.ts`. The build picks it up automatically and the
roster, filters, and counts switch on by themselves.

Astro logs "The collection tutors does not exist or is empty" while this folder
has no entries. That warning is expected and harmless.
